Description: It uses the overlap between enriched and non-enriched datasets to compensate
        for the bias introduced in global phosphorylation after applying median normalization.
        This version has enhancements not included in the Bioconductor version. Primarily,
        it treats factors more consistently, allows filtering on a lower limit of detection,
        and alows a user-specified amount of missing data.
